# No Emoji

Never put emoji (or pictograph symbols such as ⚠️ ✅ 🔴 📎 ⏳) in Vue templates, notification text, `lang/*.json` keys or values, or labels.

- In Vue UI use an icon from `@lucide/vue` (SVG), with `aria-hidden="true"` when decorative. Example: `<AlertTriangle class="size-3.5" aria-hidden="true" />`.
- In plain text (notifications, console output, translation strings) just write the words, without a symbol.
- Status colour/meaning must come from icon + text + colour classes, never from a coloured emoji dot.
